// Roustabout's loadout (openspec/changes/signature-weapons; survey G20, owner, 2026-10-26: "Approve all"). Hand-tuned:
// tools/mechs/gen_mech_data.py writes roustabout.ron and leaves this file alone. The signature weapon is first and
// starred on the WEAPONS page. Speeds m/s, intervals s, penetration mm, blast MJ, heat a share of the weapon heat
// bank (a shot, or a second of beam), which cools from full in 20 s (survey G23). Starting numbers: playtests tune them.
